OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy at first but mostly dry with
OL,7,Fonly a chance of an odd light shower.
OL,8,FIncreasingly clear spells developing
OL,9,Fthrough the evening. The night will
OL,10,Fthen continue dry with clear periods.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells in the morning, though somewhat
OL,14,Fcloudier around the east coast. The
OL,15,Fafternoon will stay dry but sunshine
OL,16,Fturning more hazy as cloud spreads
OL,17,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
